<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W group net rises in 1996.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W group net rises in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     7.53   vs    3.70</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 8.62   vs    5.10</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     5.05   vs    2.91</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    149.82   vs  119.84</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		     130.97   vs  107.57</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.03</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     3.57   vs    2.20</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		   1.75   vs    2.51</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			0.72   vs    1.15</p>
<p>    Group investment			    34.91   vs    7.76</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
